{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a boundless wilderness where you must explore, hunt, and transform to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo lets you experience the core of the full adventure: a seamless, procedurally generated world where every biome feels alive and every creature can be captured and transformed into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 9 friends as you explore a living ecosystem filled with more than 100 unique animals, each offering new ways to move, fight, and survive. Two boss fights will test your skill, adaptability, and mastery of transformation. The skill tree is disabled in this version, keeping the focus on pure exploration, experimentation, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s included in the demo:<br>\u2022 The same endless, procedurally generated world as the full game<br>\u2022 Capture and transform into over 100 animals<br>\u2022 Two boss encounters<br>\u2022 Full multiplayer support for up to ten players<br>\u2022 Skill tree progression disabled</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a genuine taste of the full experience; the same limitless world, just without full progression. It\u2019s perfect for discovering your favorite animals, testing your survival instincts, and getting lost in the wild. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085960?t=1759951539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085960?t=1759951539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085960/ab71df9829f6df1d2aeddd75779f10f363942b04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759951539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085960/ab71df9829f6df1d2aeddd75779f10f363942b04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759951539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},